{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "757cb66b0aafa8d9bee00364e618c4bddcb0044db2d51712a9ea0499c87fb61f", "ja": "風花、お疲れさま。ブログ読んだよ。\n新しい衣装、問題なさそうか？", "zh": "风花，辛苦了。我看过你的博客了。新衣服看起来没什么问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0f1f3c84f516bb204bc657e9950930812ec2af8db92fea29c731a5fc87d6cbeb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　もちろんです♪\n素敵な衣装、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！当然没问题♪\n谢谢您送我这么棒的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1002_p", "source_sha256": "36f9d9939c63f9b1011a980f0e529da5eac0b88b1ef1f419f3545f25340ccc46", "ja": "よかった、本当に気に入ってもらえたみたいだな！\n攻めた衣装だから、ちょっと心配だったんだ。", "zh": "太好了，看来你是真的很喜欢呢！\n因为这套服装挺大胆的，我之前还有点担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4c624a01b303fcc081c43a2adda7b7cf63895af4ff6b303a3f9f6238592cd3e6", "ja": "そ、そうですね。セクシーはセクシーですけど……\nでも大人可愛い感じで、カッコイイと思います♪", "zh": "是、是啊。性感是很性感，不过……\n但这种成熟可爱的感觉，我觉得很帅气♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d209d12db369b1412b1f8f86dcc644e93b863f781754361db4736fdd2bd4ddfc", "ja": "それに、莉緒さんとお揃いなのも嬉しくて……♪\nあ、ちょっとプレッシャーだったりもしますけど……。", "zh": "而且，能和莉绪姐穿同款，我也很开心……♪  \n啊，不过多少也会觉得有点压力……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2927235612c786663763b2e7f6b96e10eca5166425007287c3d9394f99a3246f", "ja": "え、どうしてプレッシャーなんだ？", "zh": "咦，为什么会有压力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "060c22465386ee5f93b69254e59ea0de87161e02f1354442b2edbd5d1315705d", "ja": "だ、だって、莉緒さんはすごく綺麗ですから。\n横に並ぶと、ときどき比べちゃって……。ううう……。", "zh": "因、因为莉绪小姐非常漂亮。\n站在她身边时，我有时会不由得拿自己和她比较……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1007_p", "source_sha256": "920cef9b7086ede0a947f782f1eb6813227e69765feddaf92ac4130411699788", "ja": "そ、そうか……。でも全然大丈夫だよ。確かに莉緒も\n綺麗だけど、風花もすごく綺麗で……魅力的だから。", "zh": "这、这样啊……不过完全没关系哦。莉绪确实很漂亮，但风花也非常漂亮……很有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1c2878afc86a1f4c4277a667d7430bbbb60a96f03a466c95151dfe028a5b8c38", "ja": "……！　ほ、ホントですか？", "zh": "……！　真、真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8c51417045c48df2d294d8f5fdf7b67332e64a08589577713efb7da253676a35", "ja": "もちろん。これからもその衣装は、たくさん着てもらい\nたいと思ってる。それぐらい魅力的だぞ！", "zh": "当然。我希望你今后也能多穿穿那套服装。它就是这么有魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6f922443e90ae423cefed78146fcd9b0e2c726dfdc4bee35961948a8354ab64a", "ja": "う、うれしい……ありがとうございます♪　じゃあ、\nたくさん着られるように、私、いろいろ頑張りますね！", "zh": "好、好开心……谢谢您♪　那为了\n能多多穿上它，我各方面都会好好加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bcaab626631b40653cec0e4a7c7e892921d6f9e1150ffa1ee5933700d943355f", "ja": "これからも、たくさん……そうですね。\n本当にたくさん、着られるといいな……。ふふっ♪", "zh": "以后也能穿很多……是啊。\n要是真的能穿很多就好了……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1012_p", "source_sha256": "522c20408d3fdd1b816ad267fbe9393d2ac23c5dab00975792cdd9bde874d2d4", "ja": "ん？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c7d067018d94e8cdf138d4f4c7e827bcabcdd2ce97684beaae193f3171b340cc", "ja": "あ、ごめんなさい。ちょっと、莉緒さんとの\n衣装合わせの時に、話したことを思い出して。", "zh": "啊，对不起。我只是想起了之前和莉绪小姐试穿服装时聊过的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ba846b8e464e9c53e978e3c2a258deb8cd20e230e7f16740872baadfbcd85793", "ja": "この衣装は、私たちが一番綺麗に見えるようにって\n作ってもらえたものですよね。だから……。", "zh": "这套服装，是为了让我们看起来最美而特意制作的吧。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e17c1adfa0a41c7301dd44870f86ede18448081b8b41450d6541b81c34fea610", "ja": "いつか大切な人ができた時にも、よく似た服を着て\nデートに行ったりするのかも……なんて♪", "zh": "也许将来有了重要的人，也会穿着相似的衣服去约会……之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c20e63a72304c14bc665a1129857adbbdd2f17afa9bbeb229c47cb446bceecb2", "ja": "あ、ごめんなさい！\nアイドルがこんなこと……ダメですよね？", "zh": "啊，对不起！\n偶像说这种话……不太好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4567dc2c7af67f7d2c6da9ed601c6696cd39158d49af067f8f9a08139fd467d4", "ja": "はは、大丈夫だよ。今はオフでプライベートみたいな\nものだし、俺と風花の二人きりなんだから。", "zh": "哈哈，没关系。现在算是休息时间，也就像是私人时间一样，毕竟这里只有我和风花两个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "54ba44538b1c35fe1539aabada6d56001ad60379af8f88b24709461804035d82", "ja": "そうですよねっ。今はプライベートで、\n{$P$}さんと私の……二人きり？", "zh": "是这样没错吧。现在是私人时间，和{$P$}先生……只有我们两个人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1019_p", "source_sha256": "41011988138dac47479b5a2de5231efe75dddcd21dcf22473562c43601e728d9", "ja": "……？　風花？", "zh": "……？　风花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0194_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2eef092ddb55b1aa2340f748a30c07b1917dff3f47b621ca7bd138e5059de355", "ja": "あ、いえっ、あの、ごめんなさいっ！\nやだ、急に意識して……うう、どうしよう……？", "zh": "啊，不是！那个，对不起！  \n讨厌，突然在意起来了……呜呜，该怎么办……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
